Fix the spelling of the custom TLS certificate configuration key.
Source: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/issues/3351

Use custom-certificates for YAML/JSON decoding and encoding, and in the example.
Tests use marker strings and do not load certificate or private-key files.

